  "details": "<p>Anduarsalla is mentioned together with Anmurru, Kiaka, Luhsu, and Pur\u1e6dir in royal inscriptions of Sargon II.\u00a0The location of Anduarsalla is unknown, but it has been suggested that this fortress was in the vicinity of classical Tomisa.</p>",
